  "contentHtml": "<p>안녕하세요 ^^</p><p>중학교 1학년 단원에 나오는 대표적 실험들을 학생들이 집에서도 할 수 있도록 만든 영상을 소개합니다.</p><p>&#160;</p><p><span style=\"color: #409d00;\" data-ke-size=\"size18\"><b>영상에 소개되는 실험재료들을 꾸러미 형태로 만들어 배부하거나 집에 있는 물건을 활용할 수 있도록 실험을 구성하면, <span style=\"color: #ef5369;\">온라인 수업</span>이나 <span style=\"color: #ef5369;\">각종 수행평가</span>, <span style=\"color: #ef5369;\">자유학기제 수업</span>에 활용할 수 있을 것 같습니다.</b></span></p><p>&#160;</p><p>또한 <span style=\"color: #f89009;\" data-ke-size=\"size18\"><b>과정편과 결과편으로 나눠서 학생들에게는 과정편만 배부</b></span>할 수도록 하시면 활용도를 높일 수 있을 것입니다.</p><p>&#160;</p><p><a href=\"https://lgsl.kr/list2/you/ser/221\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"ke-link\">https://lgsl.kr/list2/you/ser/221</a></p><div class=\"figure-open\" contenteditable=\"false\" data-ke-type=\"opengraph\" data-ke-align=\"alignCenter\" data-og-type=\"website\" data-og-title=\"시리즈 &gt; 신과람쌤과 함께하는 집콕 과학실험 꾸러미 | LG사이언스랜드\" data-og-description=\"LG사이언스랜드, 과학실험실, 스토리, 과학이야기, 과학자 인터뷰, 전공/직업 알아보기, 과학송, 웹툰, 영메이커, 시리즈, 프로젝트, 콘테스트, 호기심해결사, 과학UCC 공모전\" data-og-host=\"www.lgsl.kr\" data-og-source-url=\"https://lgsl.kr/list2/you/ser/221\" data-og-url=\"https://www.lgsl.kr/list2/you/ser/221\" data-og-image=\"https://scrap.kakaocdn.net/dn/sFDnU/hyJsmjN38y/guI8OZBvGhY78asFgFjxF0/img.jpg?width=1140&amp;height=300&amp;face=0_0_1140_300,https://scrap.kakaocdn.net/dn/b2Blm8/hyJsk7mU9Q/oOvQQk4c6A2SBS824VPyj1/img.jpg?width=1140&amp;height=300&amp;face=0_0_1140_300\"><a href=\"https://lgsl.kr/list2/you/ser/221\" target=\"_blank\" data-source-url=\"https://lgsl.kr/list2/you/ser/221\"><div class=\"og-image\" style=\"background-image:url(https://scrap.kakaocdn.net/dn/sFDnU/hyJsmjN38y/guI8OZBvGhY78asFgFjxF0/img.jpg?width=1140&amp;height=300&amp;face=0_0_1140_300,https://scrap.kakaocdn.net/dn/b2Blm8/hyJsk7mU9Q/oOvQQk4c6A2SBS824VPyj1/img.jpg?width=1140&amp;height=300&amp;face=0_0_1140_300)\"></div><div class=\"og-text\"><p class=\"og-title\">시리즈 &gt; 신과람쌤과 함께하는 집콕 과학실험 꾸러미 | LG사이언스랜드</p><p class=\"og-desc\">LG사이언스랜드, 과학실험실, 스토리, 과학이야기, 과학자 인터뷰, 전공/직업 알아보기, 과학송, 웹툰, 영메이커, 시리즈, 프로젝트, 콘테스트, 호기심해결사, 과학UCC 공모전</p><p class=\"og-host\">www.lgsl.kr</p></div></a></div><p><b>참고로 영상은 유튜브에도 올라와 있습니다.</b></p><p>&#160;</p><hr data-ke-style=\"style3\"><p><b>1. 용수철 저울 만들기 (Ⅱ. 여러 가지 힘)</b></p><p>과정편 : <a href=\"https://lgsl.kr/youser/detail/you/ser/221/22124\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"ke-link\">https://lgsl.kr/youser/detail/you/ser/221/22124</a>&#160; 또는&#160; <a href=\"https://youtu.be/TdLlGjKqP0A\" target=\"_top\" class=\"ke-link\">https://youtu.be/TdLlGjKqP0A</a></p><p>결과편 : <a href=\"https://lgsl.kr/youser/detail/you/ser/221/22123\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"ke-link\">https://lgsl.kr/youser/detail/you/ser/221/22123</a>&#160; 또는&#160; <a href=\"https://youtu.be/kw4Rekp2Fro\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"ke-link\">https://youtu.be/kw4Rekp2Fro</a></p><p>&#160;</p><p><b>2. 멸종위기종 잡기 만들기 (Ⅲ. 생물의 다양성)</b></p><p>과정편 : <a href=\"https://lgsl.kr/youser/detail/you/ser/221/22127\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"ke-link\">https://lgsl.kr/youser/detail/you/ser/221/22127</a> &#160;또는&#160; <a href=\"https://youtu.be/zi1-wWvtRsw\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"ke-link\">https://youtu.be/zi1-wWvtRsw</a></p><p>결과편 : <a href=\"https://lgsl.kr/youser/detail/you/ser/221/22126\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"ke-link\">https://lgsl.kr/youser/detail/you/ser/221/22126</a>&#160; 또는 &#160;<a href=\"https://youtu.be/xA40yj5Hwzg\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"ke-link\">https://youtu.be/xA40yj5Hwzg</a></p><p>&#160;</p><p><b>3. 기체의 부피 변화 실험 (Ⅳ. 기체의 성질)</b></p><p>과정편 : <a href=\"https://lgsl.kr/youser/detail/you/ser/221/22129\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"ke-link\">https://lgsl.kr/youser/detail/you/ser/221/22129</a>&#160; 또는&#160; <a href=\"https://youtu.be/GdHRXoWTRaU\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"ke-link\">https://youtu.be/GdHRXoWTRaU</a></p><p>결과편 : <a href=\"https://lgsl.kr/youser/detail/you/ser/221/22128\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"ke-link\">https://lgsl.kr/youser/detail/you/ser/221/22128</a> &#160;또는 &#160;<a href=\"https://youtu.be/zBoPoMh2-SE\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"ke-link\">https://youtu.be/zBoPoMh2-SE</a></p><p>&#160;</p><p><b>4. 빛의 합성 탐구하기 (Ⅵ. 빛과 파동)</b></p><p>과정편 : <a href=\"https://lgsl.kr/youser/detail/you/ser/221/22131\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"ke-link\">https://lgsl.kr/youser/detail/you/ser/221/22131</a>&#160; 또는 &#160;<a href=\"https://youtu.be/zlXEnYvcpiU\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"ke-link\">https://youtu.be/zlXEnYvcpiU</a></p><p>결과편 : <a href=\"https://lgsl.kr/youser/detail/you/ser/221/22130\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"ke-link\">https://lgsl.kr/youser/detail/you/ser/221/22130</a>&#160; 또는 &#160;<a href=\"https://youtu.be/j7xcz4oINI8\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"ke-link\">https://youtu.be/j7xcz4oINI8</a></p><p>&#160;</p><p><b>5. 암석 관찰하고 분류하기 (Ⅰ. 지권의 변화)</b></p><p>과정편 : <a href=\"https://lgsl.kr/youser/detail/you/ser/221/22143\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"ke-link\">https://lgsl.kr/youser/detail/you/ser/221/22143</a>&#160; 또는&#160; <a href=\"https://youtu.be/9nxMaYzqHNs\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"ke-link\">https://youtu.be/9nxMaYzqHNs</a></p><p>결과편 : <a href=\"https://lgsl.kr/youser/detail/you/ser/221/22142\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"ke-link\">https://lgsl.kr/youser/detail/you/ser/221/22142</a>&#160; 또는 &#160;<a href=\"https://youtu.be/CBM2wGM4vz0\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"ke-link\">https://youtu.be/CBM2wGM4vz0</a></p><p>&#160;</p><p><b>6. 얼음이 녹을 때의 온도 변화 (Ⅴ. 물질의 상태 변화)</b></p><p>과정편 : <a href=\"https://lgsl.kr/youser/detail/you/ser/221/22150\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"ke-link\">https://lgsl.kr/youser/detail/you/ser/221/22150</a>&#160; 또는 &#160;<a href=\"https://youtu.be/3TEXcbP8Dmg\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"ke-link\">https://youtu.be/3TEXcbP8Dmg</a></p><p>결과편 : <a href=\"https://lgsl.kr/youser/detail/you/ser/221/22149\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"ke-link\">https://lgsl.kr/youser/detail/you/ser/221/22149</a>&#160; 또는 &#160;<a href=\"https://youtu.be/bm9nbYRRpFc\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"ke-link\">https://youtu.be/bm9nbYRRpFc</a></p><p>&#160;</p><p>&#160;</p><p>참고로 LG사이언스에 관련 학습지가 일부 올라간 상태이고, 추가로 더 올라갈 예정입니다.</p><p>도움이 되시길 바랍니다.</p>\n\t \t\t\t\t\t<!-- -->"
